[LINK: (Laika) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laika] , a  [LINK: (Soviet space dog) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soviet_space_dogs] , was the first animal to orbit Earth, November 3, 1957

[LINK: (Yuri Gagarin) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yuri_Gagarin] , the first human and second hominid in space as well as the first primate in orbit, orbited April 12, 1961

[LINK: (Enos) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enos_(chimpanzee)] , the second of the two chimpanzees launched into space, and the only one to orbit Earth, November 29, 1961

[LINK: (Félicette) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/F%C3%A9licette] , the only cat in space, October 18, 1963

